hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"242","[AI-translation] Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi sathi ki tareef karne par majboor ho to kahe: Falan ko aisa samajhta hun, Allah us ka hisab lene wala hai; Allah ke baare mein kisi ki pakeezgi bayan nahin karta; use—agar yeh janta ho—aisa-aisa samajhta hun. [Tareef ka adab]"
